{
 "Чему равен периметр ADEFGH?": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='-10 -9 94 68' role='img' aria-label='Рисунок условия: фигура ADEFGH'><path fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='0.6' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='0.45'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#cfdae6'><circle cx='0' cy='48' r='0.9'/><circle cx='32' cy='48' r='0.9'/><circle cx='56' cy='48' r='0.9'/><circle cx='74' cy='48' r='0.9'/><circle cx='0' cy='24' r='0.9'/><circle cx='32' cy='24' r='0.9'/><circle cx='56' cy='24' r='0.9'/><circle cx='74' cy='24' r='0.9'/><circle cx='32' cy='0' r='0.9'/><circle cx='56' cy='0' r='0.9'/></g><g fill='#e8eef6' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2.5'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2.5'>F</text><text x='-3.8' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.8' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='29' y='21'>I</text><text x='59' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='53'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='53'>D</text><text x='32' y='54.5'>B</text><text x='56' y='54.5'>C</text></g></svg><figcaption>Рисунок из условия. Внизу на одной прямой A, B, C, D; над ними средняя линия H, I, J, E; наверху G над B и F над C. Стороны GH и FE — наклонные.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Обе середины — I на BG и J на CF": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Половина BI переезжает на IG'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:0.9s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M32 48L32 24'/><text x='26.5' y='38' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.0s'>m</text><path class='sl' style='--d:1.6s;--to:translate(0px,-24px)' fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' stroke-linecap='round' d='M32 48L32 24'/><text x='26.5' y='14' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.8s'>m</text><text x='37' y='58' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:3.4s'>BG = m + m = 2m</text></svg><p class='ccap'>Нижняя половина BI лежит внутри этажа, значит BI = m; I — середина, поэтому верхняя половина IG такая же.</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Вертикаль JF ложится на горизонталь BC'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:0.9s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M56 24L56 0'/><text x='61' y='14' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.0s'>m</text><path class='sl' style='--d:1.6s;--to:translate(32px,104px) rotate(-90deg)' fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' stroke-linecap='round' d='M56 24L56 0'/><text x='44' y='44' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:3.0s'>m</text><text x='37' y='58' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:3.4s'>BC = JF = m</text></svg><p class='ccap'>JF — половина CF, то есть m; условие BC = JF переносит эту длину на <i>горизонталь</i>.</p></div></div><figcaption>Обе середины сидят на средней линии, поэтому обе половины — высота этажа m. Слева нижняя половина переезжает вверх: BG = 2m. Справа вертикальная половина JF по условию равна горизонтали BC — и ширина стоячего прямоугольника тоже m.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Каждый данный периметр — обход контура по рисунку": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Контур BCFG'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M32 48L56 48L56 0L32 0Z'/><text x='44' y='52.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>m</text><text x='62' y='26' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>2m</text><text x='44' y='-3' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.1s'>m</text><text x='26' y='26' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.7s'>2m</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(1)</b> P(BCFG) = 144</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Контур ACJH'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 48L56 48L56 24L0 24Z'/><text x='28' y='52.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>b + m</text><text x='-8' y='37' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>m</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(2)</b> P(ACJH) = 160, половина — 80</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Контур BDEI'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M32 48L74 48L74 24L32 24Z'/><text x='53' y='52.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>m + e</text><text x='80' y='37' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>m</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(3)</b> P(BDEI) = 132, половина — 66</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Контур EFGH'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><text x='68' y='10' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>f</text><text x='44' y='-3' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>m</text><text x='11' y='9' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.1s'>g</text><text x='16' y='29' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.7s'>b + m + e</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(5)</b> P(EFGH) = 168</p></div></div><figcaption>Четыре данных контура — четыре уравнения. В (1) стоит одна буква m, в (2) и (3) к ней добавляется по одной новой, а в (5) после всех предыдущих неизвестным остаётся только скат f. Уравнение (4) даёт не контур, а равенство 5 · AB = 4 · GH.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Каждый спрошенный периметр — тоже обход": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Периметр ADEH'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L0 24Z'/><text x='37' y='52.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>b + m + e</text><text x='-8' y='37' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>m</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(ADEH)</b> = 2·((b + m + e) + m)</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Периметр ABGH'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 48L32 48L32 0L0 24Z'/><text x='16' y='52.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>b</text><text x='35.5' y='26' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>2m</text><text x='11' y='9' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.1s'>g</text><text x='-8' y='37' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.7s'>m</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(ABGH)</b> = b + 2m + g + m</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Периметр BDEFG'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M32 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0Z'/><text x='53' y='52.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>m + e</text><text x='79' y='37' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>m</text><text x='68' y='10' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.1s'>f</text><text x='44' y='-3' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.7s'>m</text><text x='27' y='26' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:3.3s'>2m</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(BDEFG)</b> = (m + e) + m + f + m + 2m</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -10 107 70' role='img' aria-label='Периметр ADEFGH'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.55' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.4'><path d='M0 24H74M32 0V48M56 0V48'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='32' y='-2'>G</text><text x='56' y='-2'>F</text><text x='-3.5' y='22.5'>H</text><text x='77.5' y='22.5'>E</text><text x='28.5' y='21'>I</text><text x='59.5' y='21'>J</text><text x='-3.5' y='52.5'>A</text><text x='77.5' y='52.5'>D</text><text x='32' y='54'>B</text><text x='56' y='54'>C</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 48L74 48L74 24L56 0L32 0L0 24Z'/><text x='37' y='52.8' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.9s'>b + m + e</text><text x='79' y='37' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.5s'>m</text><text x='68' y='10' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.1s'>f</text><text x='44' y='-3' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.7s'>m</text><text x='11' y='9' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:3.3s'>g</text><text x='-8' y='37' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:3.9s'>m</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(ADEFGH)</b> = (b + m + e) + m + f + m + g + m</p></div></div><figcaption>Четыре спрошенных контура — четыре обхода по одному чертежу. В ABGH и BDEFG сторона B→G идёт сквозь I целиком, поэтому она 2m, а не m. Скаты g и f входят в контур только там, где обход идёт по наклонной.</figcaption></figure>",
